(text "STM32L072CBT6. USB ROM DFU uses BOOT0 held high during NRST reset. PB2 holds the soft power latch;\nPA4 reads SYS_LOAD/2; PA5/PA6 read charger status. COUNT closes SYS to PWR_KEY; Q5 mirrors it onto COUNT_N." (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "76eca08c-6150-52fd-83e1-e67c60f50ff4"))
